<title>USA: Digital Transmissions Q4 shr loss $0.30.</title>
<headline>Digital Transmissions Q4 shr loss $0.30.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.30	   profit $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss	  1,168	   profit 214</p>
<p> Sales	     3,377		    2,964</p>
